    {
      "id": "claim_851e23a08e794421a0ac06c407e8a9d0",
      "statement": "The job queue (openswe/jobs/queue.py, openswe/jobs/worker.py) stores work in the `job` table by UUID with a `kind` and `payload`, running one-shot or cron-repeated jobs through the JobWorker which claims and dispatches each to its registered handler without invoking an LLM.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://openswe/jobs/queue.py#L1-L151",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0f012dba5b52cd24f8c72d26fe85a5d42ee014e51aba15f8a4d16ee294b1d214:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://openswe/jobs/worker.py#L1-L90",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2ad2c006e9bdcaa4984521b7d59b9c4978641b6222aeb81ec1ba424ee517562b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3682bb8bd72d486a95134e55f8c79184",
      "statement": "Every job handler is registered in openswe/jobs/kinds.py and imported at startup; handlers route by `kind` to agent_schedule (dashboard recurring), reconcile (stale-run safety), baby_sit (PR watch evaluation), background_tasks (sandbox monitoring), session_cost/agent_cost (deferred cost enrichment), announcements, human_review_deadline, workspace_refresh, thread_wakeup dispatch, and specialized handlers for merge queues, monitors, GitHub forwarding, Slack directory sync, and others.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://openswe/jobs/kinds.py#L1-L150",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:325215fcf58c3f1110831ad55d7bce77a8563f16ea08bc2e0c65e76ed441296b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d9afc0d3df954f499b1b1e919b41a09c",
      "statement": "When a job handler raises an error, the job worker retries with exponential back-off (30s * 2^(attempts-1), capped at 1 hour) up to MAX_ATTEMPTS (5); cron jobs skip to their next fire on failure while one-shot jobs give up and finish after exhausting retries.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://openswe/jobs/queue.py#L128-L150",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3b30b80b2648dba9e093a6fcb35768bd783ea468a75979de64a889b336bc92c0:"
        },
        {
