      "id": "claim_ba1fe3d1c54a452eadc1ec95d624c9e6",
      "statement": "start_watch registers each watch's per-watch job via _ensure_watch_job, which idempotently reuses an existing job tagged kind=baby_sit_watch (deleting duplicates) or creates one, and rolls back the store row and partial job if job creation fails for a brand-new watch.",
