      "statement": "On a new head SHA _evaluate_watch resets retry_count and dedupe key lists; on a genuinely new failing state it dispatches a /baby-sit --continue run to the originating agent thread whose prompt lists failing signals as untrusted data for confidence-gated diagnosis, skipping dispatch when the per-head failure fingerprint was already dispatched.",
